  "description": "SEO report and action plan inside the Umbraco 17 backoffice. Crawls your site and up to 5 competitors on a schedule, runs 40 SEO checks (indexing, technical, on-page, content), gives a technical SEO score weighted by ranking impact, shows what changed since last time, shows rankings and opportunities from Google Search Console (optional), compares you side by side with your competitors and builds a prioritised action plan with links straight to the pages in Umbraco. Free and works without any external service; optional AI (Claude and/or Jev by TypeSafe) explains the changes and makes the plan concrete, with a monthly USD cap. Dashboard UI in Danish.",
